OL,5,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,6,     FJess Gillam is joined by kora
OL,7,     Fplayer Seckou Keita to swap some
OL,8,     Fof their favourite music,
OL,9,     Fincluding Fela Sowande, Ella
OL,10,     FFitzgerald, Saint-Saens,
OL,11,     FMussorgsky and Faada Freddy.
OL,12,G1800 Opera on 3
OL,13,     FAllan Clayton stars as the outcast
OL,14,     Ffisherman in Britten's masterpiece
OL,15,     Fat the Royal Ballet and Opera,
OL,16,     Fwith a cast including Maria
OL,17,     FBengtsson as Ellen and Bryn Terfel
OL,18,     Fas Balstrode.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
